# NOTICE

This project is based on the INTERLIS 2.4 language specification:

[eCH-0031 INTERLIS 2 – Manuel de référence Version 2.1.0 (2024)](https://www.ech.ch/fr/ech/ech-0031/2.1.0)

A web-based AsciiDoc/HTML version of the reference manual is available at:

https://github.com/geostandards-ch/doc_refhb24

This repository contains an independent ANTLR4 grammar implementation
derived from the INTERLIS 2.4 specification.

The original INTERLIS grammar is defined using a WSN-based notation.
It has been translated into ANTLR4 syntax and adapted to comply with
ANTLR4 grammar requirements and parser generation constraints.

The ANTLR4 grammar contained in this repository is not an official
eCH grammar implementation and may differ from the original WSN-based
grammar representation.
